      "height": 84,
      "strokeColor": "#e67700",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "wetLocal = wetness \u00b7 wettable\neffRough = rough \u00b7 mix(1, 0.12, wetLocal)\nreflectivity = (1 \u2212 effRough)\u00b2\nif reflectivity < 0.02 \u2192 skip march\n(matte cabin skipped; wet road reflects)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
